<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <title>Free Email Signature Generator for Gmail & Outlook</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Create a professional email signature for free. Customize layouts, contact details, company logo, social links and colors. Copy formatted HTML for Gmail and Outlook or download your signature.">
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f7fb">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://converttotoolsonline.com/email-signature-generator.html">

  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Free Email Signature Generator">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Build a professional email signature with a live preview, clickable contact details and HTML export.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://converttotoolsonline.com/email-signature-generator.html">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="Free Email Signature Generator">
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Design and copy an email signature for Gmail, Outlook and other email clients.">

  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebApplication",
    "name": "Free Email Signature Generator",
    "url": "https://converttotoolsonline.com/email-signature-generator.html",
    "applicationCategory": "BusinessApplication",
    "operatingSystem": "Any",
    "isAccessibleForFree": true,
    "description": "Create a professional HTML email signature with customizable layouts, contact information, social links and a live preview."
  }
  </script>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f5f7fb;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --text: #172033;
      --muted: #667085;
      --border: #dce3ed;
      --accent: #2457d6;
      --accent-dark: #1e40af;
      --soft: #edf3ff;
      --success: #067647;
      --danger: #b42318;
      --radius: 15px;
      --shadow: 0 7px 28px rgba(25, 40, 70, .065);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      scroll-padding-top: 20px;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
        Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    button, input, select, textarea {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible,
    select:focus-visible,
    textarea:focus-visible,
    a:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid rgba(36, 87, 214, .3);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .site-header {
      background: #fff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1350px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .brand {
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .brand span {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .header-link {
      font-size: .89rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1350px, 100%);
      margin: auto;
      padding: 27px 24px 55px;
    }

    .breadcrumb {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .87rem;
    }

    .breadcrumb a {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .hero {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.3vw, 3.15rem);
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 790px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #596579;
      font-size: 1.03rem;
    }

    .benefits {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .benefit {
      padding: 6px 11px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #344054;
      font-size: .81rem;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .workspace {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(320px, .86fr) minmax(0, 1.14fr);
      align-items: start;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .panel {
      min-width: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .panel-header {
      padding: 19px 21px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .panel-header h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      letter-spacing: -.3px;
    }

    .panel-header p {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .85rem;
    }

    .panel-body {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .section {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .section:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .section-heading {
      margin: 0 0 13px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8edf4;
      font-size: .96rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .field-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 13px;
    }

    .field {
      display: flex;
      min-width: 0;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .field.full {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .field label,
    .field > span {
      color: #344054;
      font-size: .84rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .field input,
    .field select,
    .field textarea {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 41px;
      padding: 9px 11px;
      border: 1px solid #cfd7e3;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .field input[type="color"] {
      height: 43px;
      padding: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .field textarea {
      min-height: 75px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .hint {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .78rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .required {
      color: var(--danger);
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 40px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 7px;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #344054;
      font-size: .85rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background .15s, transform .15s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: #f4f7fc;
    }

    .button:active {
      transform: translateY(1px);
    }

    .button.primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .button.primary:hover {
      background: var(--accent-dark);
      border-color: var(--accent-dark);
    }

    .button.full {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .button:disabled {
      cursor: not-allowed;
      opacity: .55;
    }

    .button-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
    }

    .button.small {
      min-height: 34px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      font-size: .79rem;
    }

    .preset-label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #344054;
      font-size: .83rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .preset-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 7px;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
    }

    .color-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 13px;
    }

    .settings-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 13px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .preview-header {
      padding: 16px 19px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .preview-header h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .live-label {
      color: var(--success);
      font-size: .79rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .preview-body {
      padding: 19px;
    }

    .preview-notice {
      padding: 11px 13px;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe7fc;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #f5f8ff;
      color: #344d70;
      font-size: .81rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .email-stage {
      min-width: 0;
      min-height: 235px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 25px 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .email-stage-inner {
      min-width: 250px;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .preview-note {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .79rem;
    }

    .output-section {
      margin-top: 21px;
      padding-top: 19px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .output-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .output-heading h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: .96rem;
    }

    .code-output {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 190px;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #cfd7e3;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #101828;
      color: #e5edff;
      font: .78rem/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
      resize: vertical;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .status {
      min-height: 21px;
      margin-top: 11px;
      color: var(--success);
      font-size: .82rem;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .status.error {
      color: var(--danger);
    }

    .privacy-note {
      margin-top: 17px;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #f0f7ff;
      color: #344d70;
      font-size: .81rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .below-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, .9fr);
      align-items: start;
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .content-card {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 23px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: #fff;
    }

    .content-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 1.27rem;
      letter-spacing: -.5px;
    }

    .content-card h3 {
      margin: 20px 0 7px;
      font-size: .99rem;
    }

    .content-card p,
    .content-card li {
      color: #596579;
      font-size: .93rem;
    }

    .content-card ol,
    .content-card ul {
      padding-left: 21px;
    }

    .content-card li {
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .faq-item {
      padding: 15px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8edf4;
    }

    .faq-item:first-of-type {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .faq-item:last-child {
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .faq-item h3 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: .96rem;
    }

    .faq-item p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: .89rem;
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: .84rem;
    }

    .site-footer a {
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 950px) {
      .workspace {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .below-content {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 550px) {
      .header-inner {
        padding: 14px;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 20px 13px 38px;
      }

      .panel-body,
      .preview-body {
        padding: 14px;
      }

      .panel-header {
        padding: 15px;
      }

      .field-grid,
      .settings-grid,
      .color-grid {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .field.full {
        grid-column: auto;
      }

      .email-stage {
        padding: 18px 12px;
      }

      .content-card {
        padding: 17px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="https://converttotoolsonline.com/">
        ConvertTo<span>Tools</span>Online
      </a>
      <a class="header-link" href="https://converttotoolsonline.com/">
        Explore all tools →
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="https://converttotoolsonline.com/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
      <span>Email Signature Generator</span>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">Free business communication tool</span>
      <h1>Free Email Signature Generator</h1>
      <p>
        Create a professional email signature for work, business, freelancing,
        or personal branding. Customize your contact information, logo, colors,
        and social links, then copy your formatted signature or download the
        HTML. No account or paid export is required.
      </p>

      <div class="benefits">
        <span class="benefit">✓ Free to use</span>
        <span class="benefit">✓ Live preview</span>
        <span class="benefit">✓ Clickable contact details</span>
        <span class="benefit">✓ HTML and plain text</span>
        <span class="benefit">✓ No signup</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workspace" aria-label="Email signature generator">
      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="editorTitle">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <h2 id="editorTitle">Customize your signature</h2>
          <p>Your changes appear in the preview automatically.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-body">
          <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-heading">1. Personal information</h3>

            <div class="field-grid">
              <div class="field full">
                <label for="fullName">Full name <span class="required">*</span></label>
                <input id="fullName" type="text" maxlength="120"
                  autocomplete="name" placeholder="e.g. Alex Morgan">
              </div>

              <div class="field full">
                <label for="jobTitle">Job title</label>
                <input id="jobTitle" type="text" maxlength="120"
                  autocomplete="organization-title"
                  placeholder="e.g. Marketing Manager">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="company">Company / Organization</label>
                <input id="company" type="text" maxlength="120"
                  autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Company name">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="department">Department</label>
                <input id="department" type="text" maxlength="100"
                  placeholder="e.g. Marketing">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="emailAddress">Email address</label>
                <input id="emailAddress" type="email" maxlength="180"
                  autocomplete="email" placeholder="alex@example.com">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="phone">Phone number</label>
                <input id="phone" type="tel" maxlength="60"
                  autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+977 9800000000">
              </div>

              <div class="field full">
                <label for="website">Website / Portfolio</label>
                <input id="website" type="text" maxlength="250"
                  autocomplete="url" placeholder="https://example.com">
              </div>

              <div class="field full">
                <label for="address">Location / Business address</label>
                <input id="address" type="text" maxlength="200"
                  autocomplete="street-address"
                  placeholder="Kathmandu, Nepal">
              </div>

              <div class="field full">
                <label for="tagline">Short tagline (optional)</label>
                <input id="tagline" type="text" maxlength="180"
                  placeholder="Helping businesses grow online">
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-heading">2. Logo and social links</h3>

            <div class="field-grid">
              <div class="field full">
                <label for="logoUrl">Public logo image URL</label>
                <input id="logoUrl" type="text" maxlength="500"
                  placeholder="https://example.com/logo.png">
                <p class="hint">
                  Use a public HTTPS image URL. The image must remain accessible
                  for recipients to see it. This tool does not host your logo.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="field full">
                <label for="logoAlt">Logo alternative text</label>
                <input id="logoAlt" type="text" maxlength="150"
                  placeholder="Company logo">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="linkedin">LinkedIn profile URL</label>
                <input id="linkedin" type="text" maxlength="250"
                  placeholder="https://linkedin.com/in/username">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="instagram">Instagram profile URL</label>
                <input id="instagram" type="text" maxlength="250"
                  placeholder="https://instagram.com/username">
              </div>

              <div class="field full">
                <label for="xProfile">X / Twitter profile URL</label>
                <input id="xProfile" type="text" maxlength="250"
                  placeholder="https://x.com/username">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="bookingUrl">Meeting / Booking URL</label>
                <input id="bookingUrl" type="text" maxlength="300"
                  placeholder="https://cal.example.com/you">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="ctaLabel">Call-to-action text</label>
                <input id="ctaLabel" type="text" maxlength="60"
                  value="Book a meeting" placeholder="e.g. View portfolio">
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-heading">3. Choose your design</h3>

            <span class="preset-label">Professional templates</span>
            <div class="preset-grid">
              <button type="button" class="button small" data-template="classic">Classic</button>
              <button type="button" class="button small" data-template="modern">Modern</button>
              <button type="button" class="button small" data-template="compact">Compact</button>
              <button type="button" class="button small" data-template="corporate">Corporate</button>
            </div>

            <div class="settings-grid">
              <div class="field">
                <label for="templateSelect">Layout</label>
                <select id="templateSelect">
                  <option value="classic">Classic</option>
                  <option value="modern" selected>Modern</option>
                  <option value="compact">Compact</option>
                  <option value="corporate">Corporate</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="fontSelect">Font</label>
                <select id="fontSelect">
                  <option value="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Arial</option>
                  <option value="Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif">Verdana</option>
                  <option value="Tahoma, Geneva, sans-serif">Tahoma</option>
                  <option value="Georgia, serif">Georgia</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="accentColor">Brand color</label>
                <input id="accentColor" type="color" value="#2457d6">
              </div>

              <div class="field">
                <label for="fontSize">Text size</label>
                <select id="fontSize">
                  <option value="12">Small — 12 px</option>
                  <option value="13" selected>Medium — 13 px</option>
                  <option value="14">Large — 14 px</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="field" style="margin-top:14px">
              <label for="disclaimer">Optional short disclaimer</label>
              <textarea id="disclaimer" maxlength="350"
                placeholder="Optional notice for business emails"></textarea>
              <p class="hint">
                Keep your signature concise. A long disclaimer is rarely helpful
                in routine messages unless your organization requires one.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-heading">4. Copy or download</h3>

            <div class="button-row">
              <button type="button" id="copyFormattedButton" class="button primary">
                Copy formatted signature
              </button>
              <button type="button" id="copyHtmlButton" class="button">
                Copy HTML code
              </button>
            </div>

            <div class="button-row" style="margin-top:9px">
              <button type="button" id="copyPlainButton" class="button">
                Copy plain text
              </button>
              <button type="button" id="downloadButton" class="button">
                Download HTML file
              </button>
              <button type="button" id="sampleButton" class="button">
                Load example
              </button>
              <button type="button" id="clearButton" class="button">
                Clear details
              </button>
            </div>

            <div class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

            <div class="privacy-note">
              <strong>Privacy note:</strong> the signature is generated in your
              browser, and the code does not send the contact details you enter
              to our server. If you provide a logo URL, your browser requests the
              image from that URL for the preview; the image itself is hosted
              elsewhere.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="previewTitle">
        <div class="preview-header">
          <h2 id="previewTitle">Live email signature preview</h2>
          <span class="live-label">● Auto-updating</span>
        </div>

        <div class="preview-body">
          <div class="preview-notice">
            The preview shows the HTML design, not a guarantee of identical
            rendering in every email client. Always send yourself a test email,
            including on mobile, before using the signature professionally.
          </div>

          <div class="email-stage">
            <div class="email-stage-inner" id="signaturePreview"
              aria-label="Generated email signature preview">
              <!-- Generated signature -->
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="preview-note">
            For best results, use a concise signature, standard fonts, and a
            publicly accessible HTTPS logo. Social links are displayed as
            clickable text rather than externally hosted icon images.
          </p>

          <div class="output-section">
            <div class="output-heading">
              <h3>HTML signature code</h3>
              <button type="button" class="button small" id="selectHtmlButton">
                Select code
              </button>
            </div>

            <textarea id="htmlOutput" class="code-output" readonly
              spellcheck="false" aria-label="HTML email signature code"></textarea>

            <p class="hint" style="margin-top:9px">
              Use Copy formatted signature when you want to paste the design into
              an email signature editor. Use Copy HTML code when you need the
              underlying HTML source.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="output-section">
            <div class="output-heading">
              <h3>Plain-text version</h3>
